  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-0?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/princparshia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Profile-0?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=teal\" alt=\"個人檔案\"></a></p><p>📗 <strong>說明</strong></p><hr><p>這是 Bare Bones 材質包的簡潔附加組件，讓玻璃材質無縫連接，呈現更乾淨、更具現代感的外觀。此包保留了 Bare Bones 的簡約風格，同時增強了玻璃方塊和玻璃板的視覺效果，為您的建築帶來一體且流暢的感受。</p><p>❗ <strong>需求</strong></p><hr><ul>\n<li>Fabric/Quilt：使用 Continuity</li>\n<li>其他：使用 OptiFine</li>\n</ul><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kcbhosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d66\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PrincParshia/Resources/refs/heads/main/OFFICIAL_-_KCB_Hosting_Partnership_Banners_837x80_12.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
